+
+# Task
+
+Implement JSON Patch (RFC 6902) in `src/index.ts`, exported as `applyPatch(document, patch)`.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- Applies the six operations (add, remove, replace, move, copy, test) in order and returns a new document;
+  the input document and patch are not mutated, and the result shares no structure with them.
+- add: object member set/replaced; array index inserts (`-` appends, index > length throws); `""` replaces the document.
+- remove/replace/test: the target must exist; removing the whole document throws.
+- move/copy: `from` must exist; moving into one's own child throws; copy duplicates the value.
+- test: structural, type-strict equality; mismatch throws.
+- Invalid patch (not an array, bad operation, unknown op, missing/non-string path or from, missing value) throws.
+- Pointer rules of RFC 6901 apply to paths; `__proto__` is an ordinary member.
